  How you'll open your Apps
  Choose how phones, TVs and laptops will open your Apps. Home network needs nothing to set up.
  You can change this later in Settings, under Access.

    ● Home network (default)
    ○ Easy names at home
    ○ From anywhere, privately · coming soon
  > ○ Your own web address · coming soon
    ○ Bring your own · coming soon

  Your own web address, like movies.example.com, will open your Apps from anywhere through
  Cloudflare Tunnel, without opening any port on your router. A login page will stand in front, so
  only people you allow get in. It isn't available yet: your Apps stay on your network.

